---
code: K0027
title: Positional Not Last
severity: ERROR
since: 0.1.0
category: parse
deprecated: False
tags: [parse, syntax, ui-element, arguments]
description: "Positional element argument must appear after all named and spread arguments"
---

In UI element arguments (`#element(...)`), any positional argument (such as text content on `#text`) must appear after all named arguments (`name: value`), punned arguments (`name:`), and record spreads (`...props`).

## Example

This error occurs when a positional argument is followed by a named property, pun, or spread:

```kura
fn greeting() =>
  #text("Hello, world!", fill: red)
```

## Solution

Move the positional argument to the end of the argument list after all named and spread arguments:

```kura
fn greeting() =>
  #text(fill: red, "Hello, world!")
```
